```console
$ scherzo-cloud --help
Scherzo Cloud CLI

Usage: scherzo-cloud [COMMAND]

Commands:
  account       Manage your Scherzo Cloud account
  artifact      Work with portable workflow artifacts
  auth          Manage your Scherzo Cloud sign-in
  github        Manage GitHub connections
  organization  Manage Scherzo Cloud organizations
  project       Manage Scherzo Cloud projects
  run           Work with Scherzo Cloud runs
  version       Print version information
  runner        Work with the Scherzo Cloud runner
  workflow      Work with local workflow definitions and runs
  help          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version

```
